# Groq API key(s) for generation. Get one free at https://console.groq.com/keys
# Multiple keys are supported and round-robined: rate limits and daily token
# quotas are PER KEY, so N keys give roughly N times the throughput.
# The loader reads commented lines too, so exhausted keys can be parked with a #
# and will be picked up again after the daily reset.
GROQ_API_KEY = gsk_your_key_here
# GROQ_API_KEY = gsk_second_key_here
